{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:45 2026-10-15 HKT</p>\n<p>陳煒、姜大衛(John哥)潘靜文、孔德賢、到將軍澳電視城為台慶劇《璀璨之城》宣傳，潘靜文飾演高海寧年輕版感到好玩，可惜沒機會同張智霖做對手，但得知可以合作已開心。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳煒、姜大衛、陳瀅為台慶劇《璀璨之城》宣傳\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/920306c4727d931efaf23c59486a718e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_14_24_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"John哥和張曦雯等合作愉快。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/603baa0aecadb2657681c2750c4592c9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_14_58_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"台慶劇《璀璨之城》加強宣傳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ecab3e857d0181348f3c949af811d1ec/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_15_01_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒出名好戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5f9cb12a0226d880993bc5706e4a7474/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_15_16_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"人妻煒哥好索。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7662805469ebf827f894b841429817ee/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_15_16.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒和姜大衛約埋食飯睇劇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/358bdc917cb708fd85c3f6f63f553d80/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_15_17_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩人合作愉快。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/08983929a4509fa57c29eaedbe5d03ec/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_15_17.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜大衛指劇中以為最奸的人之後原來不是最奸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c6b44b79d8815e5a910bf1b0c871ae84/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_15_18_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒演技獲認同。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c61f471e96e638d8ea2eab5d7298fadf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_15_18.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜大衛係老戲骨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/13151d38d0e4cfcc13a7e74b20fc285c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_15_20.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孔德賢、潘靜文有份演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0a81f8ac1442cb919a8d2650427c7480/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_15_29_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"潘靜文演高海寧年輕版。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dd52e0226fc2c394618b034592085257/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_15_29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"潘靜文遺憾冇同張智霖做對手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ac53e2e425c49c9371a474b22da19a48/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_17_15_30_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>潘靜文指吳若希被淡出傳聞冇影響戲份</h2>\n<p>談到有份參演處境劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》演吳若希秘書，潘靜文表示有指吳若希被淡出該劇的傳聞沒影響戲份，自己在劇中還有其他對手，並指上星期才見到吳若希，知對方會放假計劃旅行，佩服對方收工已疲累仍繼續出席大灣區活動。</p>\n<h2>孔德賢剷陸軍裝</h2>\n<p>孔德賢為角色鏟陸軍裝新髮型，劇中跟兩位少奶互相利用但沒激情戲，但跟倪嘉雯有點到即止親熱戲，期待二人繼續合作組成螢幕CP。</p>\n<h2>陳煒姜大衛約埋食飯睇劇</h2>\n<p>陳煒和姜大衛有約埋一齊食飯睇劇，再看大家的演出也感興奮，姜大衛指劇中以為最奸的人，之後原來不是最奸，陳煒指TVB版的暴力畫面會以黑白處理，因在闔家歡時段播，完整版本可以網上看。<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T14:00:10.242502+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":402,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T12:45:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T13:58:09.582147+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:58:09.582147+00:00","content_hash":"9d0ce2f99e4ec5a496db05407afc4b10b54f46246607d2697fbda88b7474adf2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}